{
  "_comment": [
    "VowTaker item blocklist. A copy of this file is written to <RuneLite dir>/vowtaker/item-tags.json",
    "on first run. Edit THAT copy - it is merged over these defaults on every startup and is never",
    "overwritten again, so your edits survive plugin updates.",
    "",
    "Each tag entry supports:",
    "  options    - menu options this tag gates (lowercase). Empty = gate every option.",
    "  names      - case-insensitive SUBSTRING matches against the item name.",
    "  exactNames - case-insensitive WHOLE-name matches.",
    "  ids        - exact item ids. Use these when a name is ambiguous.",
    "  exclude    - substrings that veto a match, applied after names/exactNames/ids.",
    "",
    "To catch something the defaults miss (a new item, a game update, a renamed item) just add",
    "its name or id to the relevant tag. Vows reference tags by name, so anything you add is",
    "immediately enforced by every vow that blocks that tag."
  ],

